     above centered H4s + centered body prose. Original Bento-style cards
     (white bg + shadow + left-aligned) didn't match live's visual rhythm. */
  .smg-process {
    background: var(--color-brand-cream, #eedfc0);
    /* Live: 75px top, 0 bottom (next section's top padding handles spacing). */
    padding: 75px 30px 0;
  }
  .smg-process__inner {
    /* Live row max-width is 1357px — wider than the standard 1144px,
       gives the 3 cards room to breathe at 1920. */
    max-width: 1357px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .smg-process__h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display, "Oswald"), sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
