     padding, so this gives a tight cream→rust transition with no dead band.
     Hot-linked bg image for first pass (CLAUDE.md image migration rule:
     swap to local before declaring page done). */
  .smg-testi {
    background-color: var(--color-brand-rust-bright);
    background-image: url("https://www.joesvintageguitarsaz.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/rickenbacker-reviews-bg.jpg");
